sentences.text:
Three cases filed by applicant No. 1 are pending at district Court,
Lucknow, i. e. one case under Section 498A, 323, 504, 506 IPC and Sections-3/4 of D. P. Act;
another case for maintenance under Section 125 CrPC, bearing Case No. 1584 of 2023; and the third one under Section 12 of Domestic Violence Act, bearing Case No. 4299 of 2023.

